# Title: Suspicious Schtasks Execution AppData Folder
# ID: c5c00f49-b3f9-45a6-997e-cfdecc6e1967
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: pH-T (Nextron Systems), Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-03-15
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.execution, attack.persistence, attack.t1053.005, attack.t1059.001
# Description: Detects the creation of a schtask that executes a file from C:\Users\<USER>\AppData\Local
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.executable:*\\schtasks.exe AND (process.command_line:*/Create* AND process.command_line:*/RU* AND process.command_line:*/TR* AND process.command_line:*C:\\Users\\* AND process.command_line:*\\AppData\\Local\\*) AND (process.command_line:*NT AUT* OR process.command_line:* SYSTEM *)) AND NOT (((process.parent.executable:*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\* AND process.parent.executable:*TeamViewer_.exe*) AND process.executable:*\\schtasks.exe AND process.command_line:*/TN TVInstallRestore*)))
